      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "There exists packages for Linux distributions (`nextpnr-gowin`,`nextpnr-gowin-chipdb`,`python3-apycula`) but they are outdated, one needs to use the new `nextpnr-himbaechel` instead (thank you @YRabbit for telling me).",
      "source_hash": 8997778673074978579,
      "context_hash": 17987280328472003746,
      "translation": "Linux 배포판용 패키지(`nextpnr-gowin`,`nextpnr-gowin-chipdb`,`python3-apycula`)가 존재하지만 오래되었으므로, 새로운 `nextpnr-himbaechel`을 대신 사용해야 합니다(알려주신 @YRabbit께 감사드립니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
